      "dc:source": "c2021a00013rec01.pdf, p.20",
      "values:originalText": "Repeal the subsection, substitute:\n(1A) In this Act and the applicable Rules of Court, a reference to a\nFamily Court of a State is a reference to a court to which section 41\napplies.",
      "skos:definition": "Repeal the subsection, substitute:\n(1A) In this Act and the applicable Rules of Court, a reference to a\nFamily Court of a State is a reference to a court to which section 41\napplies.",
      "cml:asserts": [
