      "values:originalText": "Repeal the subsection, substitute:\n(1) After the commencement of this Act, proceedings by way of a\nmatrimonial cause shall not be instituted except under this Act.",
      "skos:definition": "Repeal the subsection, substitute:\n(1) After the commencement of this Act, proceedings by way of a\nmatrimonial cause shall not be instituted except under this Act.",
      "cml:asserts": [
