      "dc:source": "c2021a00013rec01.pdf, p.21",
      "values:originalText": "Repeal the paragraphs, substitute:\n(c) a person who is authorised to act under section 281 of the\nFederal Circuit and Family Court of Australia Act 2021 as a\nfamily counsellor; or",
      "skos:definition": "Repeal the paragraphs, substitute:\n(c) a person who is authorised to act under section 281 of the\nFederal Circuit and Family Court of Australia Act 2021 as a\nfamily counsellor; or",
      "cml:asserts": [
