      "dc:source": "c2021a00013rec01.pdf, p.25",
      "values:originalText": "Omit all the words after “have been instituted in”, substitute “the\nFederal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Division 2), may apply\nto that Court for an order transferring the proceedings to the Court, and\nthe Court may order accordingly”.\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments relating to the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia",
      "skos:definition": "Omit all the words after “have been instituted in”, substitute “the\nFederal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Division 2), may apply\nto that Court for an order transferring the proceedings to the Court, and\nthe Court may order accordingly”.\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments relating to the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia",
      "cml:asserts": [
