      "dc:source": "c2021a00013rec01.pdf, p.48",
      "values:originalText": "Repeal the following definitions:\n\nAmendments relating to the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia  Schedule 1\nAmendments  Part 1\nNo. 13, 2021\nFederal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Consequential\nAmendments and Transitional Provisions) Act 2021\n(a) definition of Federal Circuit Court;\n(b) definition of Federal Circuit Court Chief Executive Officer.",
      "skos:definition": "Repeal the following definitions:\n\nAmendments relating to the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia  Schedule 1\nAmendments  Part 1\nNo. 13, 2021\nFederal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Consequential\nAmendments and Transitional Provisions) Act 2021\n(a) definition of Federal Circuit Court;\n(b) definition of Federal Circuit Court Chief Executive Officer.",
