      "skos:note": "Repeal definitions related to Federal Circuit Court and Family Court of Australia"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2021a00013rec01#sch-1-sec-183",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "183 Section 4",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 48,
      "values:originalText": "Repeal the following definitions:\n\nAmendments relating to the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia  Schedule 1\nAmendments  Part 1\nNo. 13, 2021\nFederal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Consequential\nAmendments and Transitional Provisions) Act 2021\n(a) definition of Federal Circuit Court;\n(b) definition of Federal Circuit Court Chief Executive Officer."
