      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 50,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Marshal of the Court is responsible for:\n(a) the security of the Court; and\n\nAmendments relating to the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia  Schedule 1\nAmendments  Part 1\nNo. 13, 2021\nFederal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Consequential\nAmendments and Transitional Provisions) Act 2021\n(b) the personal security of the Judges and officers and staff of\nthe Court."
