      "cml:premiseText": "(1) The Marshal of the Court is responsible for:\n(a) the security of the Court; and\n(b) the personal security of the Judges and officers and staff of\nthe Court.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Marshal's responsibility starts during the commencement of the Act."
