      "cml:premiseText": "The Chief Executive Officer must spend the outcome amount.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The Chief Executive Officer MUST consult the person or persons mentioned in that item about the spending; and obtain the consent of: (i) the person or persons mentioned in that item to the spending; or (ii) the Attorney-General to the spending."
    },
    {
