      },
      "dc:source": "c2021a00013rec01.pdf, p.57",
      "values:originalText": "(2) The Chief Executive Officer may delegate the Chief Executive\nOfficer’s powers under paragraph (1)(b) or (c) to appoint any or all\nof the officers to the Chief Executive Officer of the Federal Circuit\nand Family Court of Australia.",
