      "dc:source": "c2021a00013rec01.pdf, p.58",
      "values:originalText": "Court of Australia\n(1) A person may be an officer of one or more of the following courts:\n(a) the Court;\n(b) the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia\n(Division 1);\n(c) the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia\n(Division 2).\n(2) Subsection (1) has effect despite anything in this Act and the\nFederal Circuit and Family Court of Australia Act 2021.",
      "skos:definition": "Court of Australia\n(1) A person may be an officer of one or more of the following courts:\n(a) the Court;\n(b) the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia\n(Division 1);\n(c) the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia\n(Division 2).\n(2) Subsection (1) has effect despite anything in this Act and the\nFederal Circuit and Family Court of Australia Act 2021.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
