      },
      "dc:source": "c2021a00013rec01.pdf, p.59",
      "values:originalText": "Repeal the subsection, substitute:\n(8A) The Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Division 1) has\njurisdiction in a matter that:\n(a) is the subject of a proceeding transferred to the Federal\nCircuit and Family Court of Australia (Division 1) under this\nsection; and\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments relating to the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia",
      "skos:definition": "Repeal the subsection, substitute:\n(8A) The Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Division 1) has\njurisdiction in a matter that:\n(a) is the subject of a proceeding transferred to the Federal\nCircuit and Family Court of Australia (Division 1) under this\nsection; and\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments relating to the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia",
      "cml:asserts": [
