      "values:originalText": "(1) If:\n(a) a proceeding is pending in the Federal Circuit and Family\nCourt of Australia (Division 2); and\n(b) the proceeding is not a family law or child support\nproceeding;\nthe Court may, by order, transfer the proceeding from the Federal\nCircuit and Family Court of Australia (Division 2) to the Court."
