      "dc:source": "c2021a00013rec01.pdf, p.60",
      "values:originalText": "(3) The Rules of Court may make provision in relation to transfers of\nproceedings from the Federal Circuit and Family Court of\nAustralia (Division 2) under this section.\n\nAmendments relating to the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia  Schedule 1\nAmendments  Part 1\nNo. 13, 2021\nFederal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Consequential\nAmendments and Transitional Provisions) Act 2021",
      "skos:definition": "(3) The Rules of Court may make provision in relation to transfers of\nproceedings from the Federal Circuit and Family Court of\nAustralia (Division 2) under this section.\n\nAmendments relating to the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia  Schedule 1\nAmendments  Part 1\nNo. 13, 2021\nFederal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Consequential\nAmendments and Transitional Provisions) Act 2021",
