      },
      "dc:source": "c2021a00013rec01.pdf, p.60",
      "values:originalText": "(5) Before Rules of Court are made for the purposes of subsection (3)\nor (4), the Court must consult the Federal Circuit and Family Court\nof Australia (Division 2).",
      "skos:definition": "(5) Before Rules of Court are made for the purposes of subsection (3)\nor (4), the Court must consult the Federal Circuit and Family Court\nof Australia (Division 2).",
