      "values:originalText": "(8) The Court has jurisdiction in a matter that:\n(a) is the subject of a proceeding transferred to the Court under\nthis section; and\n(b) is a matter in which the Court does not have jurisdiction apart\nfrom this subsection.\nTo avoid doubt, the Court’s jurisdiction under this subsection is not\nsubject to limits set by another provision.",
      "skos:definition": "(8) The Court has jurisdiction in a matter that:\n(a) is the subject of a proceeding transferred to the Court under\nthis section; and\n(b) is a matter in which the Court does not have jurisdiction apart\nfrom this subsection.\nTo avoid doubt, the Court’s jurisdiction under this subsection is not\nsubject to limits set by another provision.",
