      "dc:source": "c2021a00013rec01.pdf, p.69",
      "values:originalText": "The amendment of the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia\nAct 2021 made by this Part applies in relation to a Judge of the Federal\nCircuit and Family Court of Australia (Division 2) or a retired disabled\nJudge (within the meaning of that Act) who dies on or after the day this\nitem commences.\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments relating to the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia",
      "skos:definition": "The amendment of the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia\nAct 2021 made by this Part applies in relation to a Judge of the Federal\nCircuit and Family Court of Australia (Division 2) or a retired disabled\nJudge (within the meaning of that Act) who dies on or after the day this\nitem commences.\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments relating to the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2021a00013rec01-sch-1-sec-240-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "e30ee7bd321b8052027bb57357f2af50ec4330c7c190afeb5137ec9293da4934",
      "skos:note": "Application provision for amendment of Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia Act 2021"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2021a00013rec01#sch-1-sec-240",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "240 Application provision",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 69,
      "values:originalText": "The amendment of the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia\nAct 2021 made by this Part applies in relation to a Judge of the Federal\nCircuit and Family Court of Australia (Division 2) or a retired disabled\nJudge (within the meaning of that Act) who dies on or after the day this\nitem commences.\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments relating to the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia"
    },
