      "values:originalText": "Repeal the subsection, substitute:\n(2) The function of the Rules Advisory Committee is to advise the\nJudges of the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia\n(Division 1) in relation to the making of standard Rules of Court as\nrequested from time to time.\nFederal Circuit and Family Court of Australia Act 2021"
