      "cof:title": "17 Subsection 3(1)",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 77,
      "values:originalText": "Insert:\nFederal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Division 2) Rules\nmeans the Rules of Court made under Chapter 4 of the Federal\nCircuit and Family Court of Australia Act 2021."
