      "dc:source": "c2021a00013rec01.pdf, p.77",
      "values:originalText": "Repeal the following definitions:\n(a) definition of Federal Circuit Court;\n(b) definition of Federal Circuit Court Rules;\n(c) definition of the Family Court.",
      "skos:definition": "Repeal the following definitions:\n(a) definition of Federal Circuit Court;\n(b) definition of Federal Circuit Court Rules;\n(c) definition of the Family Court.",
