      "values:originalText": "Repeal the subsection, substitute:\n(2) The Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Division 2) has\njurisdiction to hear and determine applications made to the Court\nunder this Act.\nNote:\nSee also subsections 3(10) and (11)."
    },
