      "values:originalText": "superior court)\nInsert:\n(da) a State Family Court (being a court to which section 41 of the\nFamily Law Act 1975 applies); or\n\nFurther consequential amendments  Schedule 2\n\nNo. 13, 2021\nFederal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Consequential\nAmendments and Transitional Provisions) Act 2021\nAustralian Sports Anti-Doping Authority Act 2006",
      "skos:definition": "superior court)\nInsert:\n(da) a State Family Court (being a court to which section 41 of the\nFamily Law Act 1975 applies); or\n\nFurther consequential amendments  Schedule 2\n\nNo. 13, 2021\nFederal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Consequential\nAmendments and Transitional Provisions) Act 2021\nAustralian Sports Anti-Doping Authority Act 2006",
