      "skos:note": "Transfer a proceeding to the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Division 1) on application or initiative."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2021a00013rec01#sch-2-sec-132",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "132 Subsection 35A(2A)",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 92,
      "values:originalText": "Repeal the subsection, substitute:\n(2A) If a proceeding is pending in the Federal Circuit and Family Court\nof Australia (Division 2), the Court may, on the application of a\nparty to the proceeding or on its own initiative, transfer the\nproceeding to the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia\n(Division 1)."
    },
