      "values:originalText": "Repeal the subsection, substitute:\n(5) An appeal does not lie from a decision of the Federal Court or the\nFederal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Division 2) in\nrelation to the transfer of a proceeding under this Act to the Federal\nCircuit and Family Court of Australia (Division 1).",
