      "dc:source": "c2021a00013rec01.pdf, p.97",
      "values:originalText": "Add:\n\nSchedule 2  Further consequential amendments\n\nFederal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Consequential\nAmendments and Transitional Provisions) Act 2021\nNo. 13, 2021\nNote:\nFor appeals in relation to this Act, see section 26 of the Federal\nCircuit and Family Court of Australia Act 2021 and section 47A of\nthe Family Law Act 1975.",
      "skos:definition": "Add:\n\nSchedule 2  Further consequential amendments\n\nFederal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Consequential\nAmendments and Transitional Provisions) Act 2021\nNo. 13, 2021\nNote:\nFor appeals in relation to this Act, see section 26 of the Federal\nCircuit and Family Court of Australia Act 2021 and section 47A of\nthe Family Law Act 1975.",
