      "dc:source": "c2021a00013rec01.pdf, p.101",
      "values:originalText": "Omit “(other than Part X of that Act), the standard Rules of Court and\nthe related Federal Circuit Court Rules”, substitute “(other than\nDivision 4 of Part V of that Act), the standard Rules of Court, the\nFederal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Division 1) Rules and\nthe related Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Division 2)\nRules”.",
