      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(1) A Family Court of a State has jurisdiction to hear and determine\nappeals from a decree of a court of summary jurisdiction of the\nState.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "A Family Court must provide jurisdiction to hear and determine appeals."
    },
