      "cof:pageNumber": 116,
      "values:originalText": "(1) An appointment that is in force immediately before the\ncommencement day under subsection 105.2(1) in respect of a\nJudge of the Federal Circuit Court of Australia continues in force,\non and after that day, as an appointment in respect of a Judge of the\nFederal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Division 2) under\nthat subsection."
    },
