      "dc:source": "c2021a00013rec01.pdf, p.116",
      "values:originalText": "(2) A consent that is in force immediately before the commencement\nday under subsection 105.2(2) in respect of a Judge of the Federal\nCircuit Court of Australia continues in force, on and after that day,\n\nFurther consequential amendments  Schedule 2\n\nNo. 13, 2021\nFederal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Consequential\nAmendments and Transitional Provisions) Act 2021\nas a consent in respect of a Judge of the Federal Circuit and Family\nCourt of Australia (Division 2).",
      "skos:definition": "(2) A consent that is in force immediately before the commencement\nday under subsection 105.2(2) in respect of a Judge of the Federal\nCircuit Court of Australia continues in force, on and after that day,\n\nFurther consequential amendments  Schedule 2\n\nNo. 13, 2021\nFederal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Consequential\nAmendments and Transitional Provisions) Act 2021\nas a consent in respect of a Judge of the Federal Circuit and Family\nCourt of Australia (Division 2).",
