      "dc:source": "c2021a00013rec01.pdf, p.116",
      "values:originalText": "(3) A thing done by, or in relation to, a Judge of the Federal Circuit\nCourt of Australia, as an issuing authority for continued\npreventative detention orders, under Division 105 before the\ncommencement day has effect, on and after that day, as if it had\nbeen done by, or in relation to, a Judge of the Federal Circuit and\nFamily Court of Australia (Division 2), as an issuing authority for\ncontinued preventative detention orders, under that Division.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) A thing done by, or in relation to, a Judge of the Federal Circuit\nCourt of Australia, as an issuing authority for continued\npreventative detention orders, under Division 105 before the\ncommencement day has effect, on and after that day, as if it had\nbeen done by, or in relation to, a Judge of the Federal Circuit and\nFamily Court of Australia (Division 2), as an issuing authority for\ncontinued preventative detention orders, under that Division.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:c2021a00013rec01-sch-2-sec-106-3"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2021a00013rec01-sch-2-sec-106-3-ss-3-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "a64267200f80c2360561e5330cbb63e3f7a81c8492efba717563d9f74be0208c",
      "skos:note": "Continuation of preventative detention orders"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2021a00013rec01#sch-2-sec-106-3-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "106(3) 4  Saving—Judges of the Federal Circuit Court",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 116,
      "values:originalText": "(3) A thing done by, or in relation to, a Judge of the Federal Circuit\nCourt of Australia, as an issuing authority for continued\npreventative detention orders, under Division 105 before the\ncommencement day has effect, on and after that day, as if it had\nbeen done by, or in relation to, a Judge of the Federal Circuit and\nFamily Court of Australia (Division 2), as an issuing authority for\ncontinued preventative detention orders, under that Division."
    },
