      "dc:source": "c2021a00013rec01.pdf, p.123",
      "values:originalText": "Repeal the subsection, substitute:\n(5A) Despite subsection (5), this Act applies to an appeal to the Federal\nCircuit and Family Court of Australia (Division 1) from a court of\nsummary jurisdiction of a State or Territory exercising jurisdiction\nunder the Family Law Act 1975.\nExtradition Act 1988",
      "skos:definition": "Repeal the subsection, substitute:\n(5A) Despite subsection (5), this Act applies to an appeal to the Federal\nCircuit and Family Court of Australia (Division 1) from a court of\nsummary jurisdiction of a State or Territory exercising jurisdiction\nunder the Family Law Act 1975.\nExtradition Act 1988",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
