    {
      "@id": "concept:c2021a00013rec01-sch-2-sec-568",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "568 No limitation on powers of the Federal Circuit and Family",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2021a00013rec01#sch-2-sec-568"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2021a00013rec01.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2021a00013rec01.pdf, p.130",
      "values:originalText": "Court of Australia (Division 2)\nTo avoid doubt, nothing in this Act limits the powers of the Federal\nCircuit and Family Court of Australia (Division 2) under\nsection 139, 140 or 141 of the Federal Circuit and Family Court of\nAustralia Act 2021.",
      "skos:definition": "Court of Australia (Division 2)\nTo avoid doubt, nothing in this Act limits the powers of the Federal\nCircuit and Family Court of Australia (Division 2) under\nsection 139, 140 or 141 of the Federal Circuit and Family Court of\nAustralia Act 2021.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2021a00013rec01-sch-2-sec-568-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "0ded20c94d29d36f42f2a0f4f4ed761041d5828e2b2aa8862d21d12423fe417e",
      "skos:note": "No limitation on powers of the Federal Circuit and Family Court"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2021a00013rec01#sch-2-sec-568",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "568 No limitation on powers of the Federal Circuit and Family",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 130,
      "values:originalText": "Court of Australia (Division 2)\nTo avoid doubt, nothing in this Act limits the powers of the Federal\nCircuit and Family Court of Australia (Division 2) under\nsection 139, 140 or 141 of the Federal Circuit and Family Court of\nAustralia Act 2021."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2021a00013rec01-sch-2-sec-568-norm",
      "@type": "values:Undertaking",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
