      "values:originalText": "Omit “Federal Circuit Court”, substitute “Federal Circuit and Family\nCourt of Australia (Division 2)”.\n\nSchedule 2  Further consequential amendments\n\nFederal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Consequential\nAmendments and Transitional Provisions) Act 2021\nNo. 13, 2021\nFair Work (Transitional Provisions and Consequential\nAmendments) Act 2009",
