      "dc:source": "c2021a00013rec01.pdf, p.133",
      "values:originalText": "Court of Australia (Division 2)\nTo avoid doubt, nothing in this Act limits the powers of the Federal\nCircuit and Family Court of Australia (Division 2) under section 139,\n140 or 141 of the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia Act\n2021.\nFamily Court of Western Australia (Orders of Registrars)\nAct 1997",
      "skos:definition": "Court of Australia (Division 2)\nTo avoid doubt, nothing in this Act limits the powers of the Federal\nCircuit and Family Court of Australia (Division 2) under section 139,\n140 or 141 of the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia Act\n2021.\nFamily Court of Western Australia (Orders of Registrars)\nAct 1997",
