      "values:originalText": "•\nThe Federal Court or the Federal Circuit and Family Court of\nAustralia (Division 2) may grant an injunction in relation to a\ncontravention of the relevant Commonwealth Procurement\nRules (so far as those rules relate to a covered procurement).",
