      "values:originalText": "•\nThe Federal Court or the Federal Circuit and Family Court of\nAustralia (Division 2) may order the payment of\ncompensation for a contravention of the relevant\nCommonwealth Procurement Rules (so far as those rules\nrelate to a covered procurement).",
