      "dc:source": "c2021a00013rec01.pdf, p.142",
      "values:originalText": "Repeal the note, substitute:\nNote:\nA proceeding pending in the Federal Circuit and Family Court of\nAustralia (Division 2) may be transferred to the Federal Court of\nAustralia: see section 153 of the Federal Circuit and Family Court of\nAustralia Act 2021 and section 32AC of the Federal Court of\nAustralia Act 1976.\n\nFurther consequential amendments  Schedule 2\n\nNo. 13, 2021\nFederal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Consequential\nAmendments and Transitional Provisions) Act 2021",
