      "dc:source": "c2021a00013rec01.pdf, p.145",
      "values:originalText": "appropriate current judicial salary)\nInsert:\n(ba) in the case of a Judge who was a Chief Justice of the Family\nCourt of Australia—the salary for the time being payable to\nthe Chief Justice of the Federal Circuit and Family Court of\nAustralia (Division 1); and\n(bb) in the case of a Judge who was a Deputy Chief Justice of the\nFamily Court of Australia—the salary for the time being\npayable to the Deputy Chief Justice of the Federal Circuit\nand Family Court of Australia (Division 1); and",
      "skos:definition": "appropriate current judicial salary)\nInsert:\n(ba) in the case of a Judge who was a Chief Justice of the Family\nCourt of Australia—the salary for the time being payable to\nthe Chief Justice of the Federal Circuit and Family Court of\nAustralia (Division 1); and\n(bb) in the case of a Judge who was a Deputy Chief Justice of the\nFamily Court of Australia—the salary for the time being\npayable to the Deputy Chief Justice of the Federal Circuit\nand Family Court of Australia (Division 1); and",
