      "dc:source": "c2021a00013rec01.pdf, p.146",
      "values:originalText": "Add:\n(3) To avoid doubt, a person may satisfy the definition of Judge at a\nparticular time even if the person also holds, at the same time, an\noffice as a Judge of the Federal Circuit and Family Court of\nAustralia (Division 2).\nNote:\nSee paragraph (a) of the definition of Judge in subsection 4(1).\n\nFurther consequential amendments  Schedule 2\n\nNo. 13, 2021\nFederal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Consequential\nAmendments and Transitional Provisions) Act 2021\nJudicial and Statutory Officers (Remuneration and\nAllowances) Act 1984",
      "skos:definition": "Add:\n(3) To avoid doubt, a person may satisfy the definition of Judge at a\nparticular time even if the person also holds, at the same time, an\noffice as a Judge of the Federal Circuit and Family Court of\nAustralia (Division 2).\nNote:\nSee paragraph (a) of the definition of Judge in subsection 4(1).\n\nFurther consequential amendments  Schedule 2\n\nNo. 13, 2021\nFederal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Consequential\nAmendments and Transitional Provisions) Act 2021\nJudicial and Statutory Officers (Remuneration and\nAllowances) Act 1984",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2021a00013rec01-sch-2-sec-490-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "981551ade21839575b9730e79e79e800451e1c12adb8ad795423ad81b0cf1ebe",
      "skos:note": "A person may satisfy the definition of Judge even if holding another office."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2021a00013rec01#sch-2-sec-490",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "490 At the end of section 5",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 146,
      "values:originalText": "Add:\n(3) To avoid doubt, a person may satisfy the definition of Judge at a\nparticular time even if the person also holds, at the same time, an\noffice as a Judge of the Federal Circuit and Family Court of\nAustralia (Division 2).\nNote:\nSee paragraph (a) of the definition of Judge in subsection 4(1).\n\nFurther consequential amendments  Schedule 2\n\nNo. 13, 2021\nFederal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Consequential\nAmendments and Transitional Provisions) Act 2021\nJudicial and Statutory Officers (Remuneration and\nAllowances) Act 1984"
    },
    {
