      "values:originalText": "Insert:\nFederal Circuit and Family Court of Australia means:\n(a) the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia\n(Division 1); or\n(b) the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia\n(Division 2).\n\nSchedule 2  Further consequential amendments\n\nFederal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Consequential\nAmendments and Transitional Provisions) Act 2021\nNo. 13, 2021\nJurisdiction of Courts (Cross-vesting) Act 1987",
