      "skos:definition": "Omit “Family Court of Australia, the Federal Circuit Court of\nAustralia”, substitute “Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia\n(Division 1), the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia\n(Division 2)”.\nMarriage Amendment (Definition and Religious Freedoms)\nAct 2017",
