      "values:originalText": "Omit “eligible Federal Circuit Court Judge”, substitute “eligible Judge”.\n\nSchedule 2  Further consequential amendments\n\nFederal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Consequential\nAmendments and Transitional Provisions) Act 2021\nNo. 13, 2021",
      "skos:definition": "Omit “eligible Federal Circuit Court Judge”, substitute “eligible Judge”.\n\nSchedule 2  Further consequential amendments\n\nFederal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Consequential\nAmendments and Transitional Provisions) Act 2021\nNo. 13, 2021",
