      "skos:note": "Jurisdiction on Federal Court and Family Court of Australia"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2021a00013rec01#sch-2-sec-666",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "666 Section 297",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 172,
      "values:originalText": "Omit:\n\nFurther consequential amendments  Schedule 2\n\nNo. 13, 2021\nFederal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Consequential\nAmendments and Transitional Provisions) Act 2021\nDivision 3 confers jurisdiction on the Federal Court and the\nFederal Circuit Court.\nsubstitute:\nDivision 3 confers jurisdiction on the Federal Court and the\nFederal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Division 2)."
    },
