      "dc:source": "c2021a00013rec01.pdf, p.176",
      "values:originalText": "Repeal the table, substitute:\nTransfers to which other legislation applies\nItem\nTransferring court\nReceiving court\nThe Federal Court\nThe Federal Court\nThe Federal Court\nThe Federal Circuit and Family Court\nof Australia (Division 2)\nThe Federal Circuit and Family\nCourt of Australia (Division 1)\nThe Federal Circuit and Family Court\nof Australia (Division 2)\n\nFurther consequential amendments  Schedule 2\n\nNo. 13, 2021\nFederal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Consequential\nAmendments and Transitional Provisions) Act 2021\nTransfers to which other legislation applies\nItem\nTransferring court\nReceiving court\nThe Federal Circuit and Family\nCourt of Australia (Division 2)\nThe Federal Court or the Federal\nCircuit and Family Court of Australia\n(Division 1)",
      "skos:definition": "Repeal the table, substitute:\nTransfers to which other legislation applies\nItem\nTransferring court\nReceiving court\nThe Federal Court\nThe Federal Court\nThe Federal Court\nThe Federal Circuit and Family Court\nof Australia (Division 2)\nThe Federal Circuit and Family\nCourt of Australia (Division 1)\nThe Federal Circuit and Family Court\nof Australia (Division 2)\n\nFurther consequential amendments  Schedule 2\n\nNo. 13, 2021\nFederal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Consequential\nAmendments and Transitional Provisions) Act 2021\nTransfers to which other legislation applies\nItem\nTransferring court\nReceiving court\nThe Federal Circuit and Family\nCourt of Australia (Division 2)\nThe Federal Court or the Federal\nCircuit and Family Court of Australia\n(Division 1)",
      "cml:asserts": [
