      "dc:source": "c2021a00013rec01.pdf, p.177",
      "values:originalText": "Repeal the note, substitute:\nNote 2:\nTransfers mentioned in the table are covered by other legislation as\nfollows:\n(a)\nfor a transfer mentioned in item 1—section 32AC of the Federal\nCourt of Australia Act 1976;\n(b)\nfor a transfer mentioned in item 2—section 32AB of the Federal\nCourt of Australia Act 1976;\n(c)\nfor a transfer mentioned in item 3—section 52 of the Federal\nCircuit and Family Court of Australia Act 2021;\n(d)\nfor a transfer mentioned in item 4—sections 149 and 153 of the\nFederal Circuit and Family Court of Australia Act 2021.",
      "skos:definition": "Repeal the note, substitute:\nNote 2:\nTransfers mentioned in the table are covered by other legislation as\nfollows:\n(a)\nfor a transfer mentioned in item 1—section 32AC of the Federal\nCourt of Australia Act 1976;\n(b)\nfor a transfer mentioned in item 2—section 32AB of the Federal\nCourt of Australia Act 1976;\n(c)\nfor a transfer mentioned in item 3—section 52 of the Federal\nCircuit and Family Court of Australia Act 2021;\n(d)\nfor a transfer mentioned in item 4—sections 149 and 153 of the\nFederal Circuit and Family Court of Australia Act 2021.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2021a00013rec01-sch-2-sec-679-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "783e45ad5375f56d9a57fecb700b9e40640e002ba356916c584fa7e0c60a1982",
      "skos:note": "Transfers mentioned in the table are covered by other legislation."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2021a00013rec01#sch-2-sec-679",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "679 Subsection 210(2) (note 2)",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 177,
      "values:originalText": "Repeal the note, substitute:\nNote 2:\nTransfers mentioned in the table are covered by other legislation as\nfollows:\n(a)\nfor a transfer mentioned in item 1—section 32AC of the Federal\nCourt of Australia Act 1976;\n(b)\nfor a transfer mentioned in item 2—section 32AB of the Federal\nCourt of Australia Act 1976;\n(c)\nfor a transfer mentioned in item 3—section 52 of the Federal\nCircuit and Family Court of Australia Act 2021;\n(d)\nfor a transfer mentioned in item 4—sections 149 and 153 of the\nFederal Circuit and Family Court of Australia Act 2021."
    },
