      "values:originalText": "Omit:\nDivision 7 provides for compensation orders, and other orders, to\nbe made by the Federal Court or Federal Circuit Court.\nsubstitute:\nDivision 7 provides for compensation orders, and other orders, to\nbe made by the Federal Court or Federal Circuit and Family Court\nof Australia (Division 2).",
