      "values:originalText": "A written authorisation made under subsection 58(2) of the Federal\nCircuit Court of Australia Act 1999 and in force immediately before the\ncommencement day continues in force (and may be dealt with) as if it\nhad been made under subsection 194(2) of the Federal Circuit and\nFamily Court of Australia Act 2021.",
      "skos:definition": "A written authorisation made under subsection 58(2) of the Federal\nCircuit Court of Australia Act 1999 and in force immediately before the\ncommencement day continues in force (and may be dealt with) as if it\nhad been made under subsection 194(2) of the Federal Circuit and\nFamily Court of Australia Act 2021.",
      "cml:asserts": [
