      "dc:source": "c2021a00013rec01.pdf, p.201",
      "values:originalText": "An instrument made under section 117A of the Federal Circuit Court of\nAustralia Act 1999 and in force immediately before the commencement\nday continues in force (and may be dealt with) as if it had been made\nunder section 275 of the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia\nAct 2021.",
