      "dc:source": "c2021a00013rec01.pdf, p.204",
      "values:originalText": "Repeal the subparagraph, substitute:\n(ii) the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia\n(Division 2); or\n\nContingent amendments  Schedule 4\nFair Work Laws Amendment (Proper Use of Worker Benefits) Act 2021  Part 3\nNo. 13, 2021\nFederal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Consequential\nAmendments and Transitional Provisions) Act 2021",
      "skos:definition": "Repeal the subparagraph, substitute:\n(ii) the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia\n(Division 2); or\n\nContingent amendments  Schedule 4\nFair Work Laws Amendment (Proper Use of Worker Benefits) Act 2021  Part 3\nNo. 13, 2021\nFederal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Consequential\nAmendments and Transitional Provisions) Act 2021",
      "cml:asserts": [
