    {
      "@id": "concept:c2021a00013rec01-sch-5-sec-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "4 Chief Executive Officer of the Family Court of Australia",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2021a00013rec01#sch-5-sec-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2021a00013rec01.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2021a00013rec01.pdf, p.216",
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nA person who was, immediately before the commencement day,\nholding office as the Chief Executive Officer and Principal Registrar of\nthe Family Court of Australia, continues to hold that office under the\ntitle of the Chief Executive Officer and Principal Registrar of the\nFederal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Division 1).\n(2)\nThe person holds office, on and after the commencement day:\n\nTransitional provisions  Schedule 5\nContinuity of the Family Court of Australia, and Judges and personnel of the Court",
      "skos:definition": "(1)\nA person who was, immediately before the commencement day,\nholding office as the Chief Executive Officer and Principal Registrar of\nthe Family Court of Australia, continues to hold that office under the\ntitle of the Chief Executive Officer and Principal Registrar of the\nFederal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Division 1).\n(2)\nThe person holds office, on and after the commencement day:\n\nTransitional provisions  Schedule 5\nContinuity of the Family Court of Australia, and Judges and personnel of the Court",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2021a00013rec01-sch-5-sec-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2021a00013rec01-sch-5-sec-4-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "3360da30ee72e08f8baa1e9f74173dc8d253c2f367dfe314f2e7b7c9abd0faf8",
      "skos:note": "Continuity of office for Chief Executive Officer and Principal Registrar"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2021a00013rec01#sch-5-sec-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "4 Chief Executive Officer of the Family Court of Australia",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 216,
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nA person who was, immediately before the commencement day,\nholding office as the Chief Executive Officer and Principal Registrar of\nthe Family Court of Australia, continues to hold that office under the\ntitle of the Chief Executive Officer and Principal Registrar of the\nFederal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Division 1).\n(2)\nThe person holds office, on and after the commencement day:\n\nTransitional provisions  Schedule 5\nContinuity of the Family Court of Australia, and Judges and personnel of the Court"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2021a00013rec01-sch-5-sec-4-norm",
