    {
      "@id": "concept:c2021a00013rec01-sch-5-sec-5",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "5 Officers and staff of the Family Court of Australia",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2021a00013rec01#sch-5-sec-5"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2021a00013rec01.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2021a00013rec01.pdf, p.217",
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nA person who, immediately before the commencement day, was an\nofficer of the Family Court of Australia, as mentioned in\nparagraph 38N(1)(b), (c), (d), (e) or (f) of the old law, continues on and\nafter that day as an officer of the Federal Circuit and Family Court of\nAustralia (Division 1).\n(2)\nA person who, immediately before the commencement day, was a\nmember of the staff of the Registries of the Family Court of Australia\n(as mentioned in subsection 38N(7) of the old law), continues on and\nafter that day as a member of the staff of the Registries of the Federal\nCircuit and Family Court of Australia (Division 1).\n(3)\nIn this item:\nold law means Part IVA of the Family Law Act 1975, as in force\nimmediately before the commencement day.",
      "skos:definition": "(1)\nA person who, immediately before the commencement day, was an\nofficer of the Family Court of Australia, as mentioned in\nparagraph 38N(1)(b), (c), (d), (e) or (f) of the old law, continues on and\nafter that day as an officer of the Federal Circuit and Family Court of\nAustralia (Division 1).\n(2)\nA person who, immediately before the commencement day, was a\nmember of the staff of the Registries of the Family Court of Australia\n(as mentioned in subsection 38N(7) of the old law), continues on and\nafter that day as a member of the staff of the Registries of the Federal\nCircuit and Family Court of Australia (Division 1).\n(3)\nIn this item:\nold law means Part IVA of the Family Law Act 1975, as in force\nimmediately before the commencement day.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2021a00013rec01-sch-5-sec-5-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2021a00013rec01-sch-5-sec-5-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2021a00013rec01-sch-5-sec-5-logic-descriptionlogic-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "164a72fb7c5f7cf4475b7401c140a225983081de149cd53957723f7d082af7d1",
      "skos:note": "Continuation of officers and staff after commencement day"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2021a00013rec01#sch-5-sec-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "5 Officers and staff of the Family Court of Australia",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 217,
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nA person who, immediately before the commencement day, was an\nofficer of the Family Court of Australia, as mentioned in\nparagraph 38N(1)(b), (c), (d), (e) or (f) of the old law, continues on and\nafter that day as an officer of the Federal Circuit and Family Court of\nAustralia (Division 1).\n(2)\nA person who, immediately before the commencement day, was a\nmember of the staff of the Registries of the Family Court of Australia\n(as mentioned in subsection 38N(7) of the old law), continues on and\nafter that day as a member of the staff of the Registries of the Federal\nCircuit and Family Court of Australia (Division 1).\n(3)\nIn this item:\nold law means Part IVA of the Family Law Act 1975, as in force\nimmediately before the commencement day."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2021a00013rec01-sch-5-sec-5-norm",
      "@type": "values:Undertaking",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:c2021a00013rec01-sch-5-sec-5"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2021a00013rec01-sch-5-sec-5-logic-deontic-1",
