          "@id": "concept:c2021a00013rec01-sch-5-sec-10-logic-descriptionlogic-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2021a00013rec01-sch-5-sec-10-logic-descriptionlogic-4"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "bb9f00d2b06cc3011b25156da0623108be3a9a146fa4edd8aae1723b0372d3aa",
      "skos:note": "Things done by, or in relation to, a Registry Manager"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2021a00013rec01#sch-5-sec-10",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "10 Things done by, or in relation to, a Registry Manager",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 219,
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nIf a thing was done by, or in relation to, the Registry Manager of a\nRegistry of the Family Court of Australia, then the thing is taken, for\nthe purposes of the operation of any law on and after the\ncommencement day, to have been done by, or in relation to, the\nRegistry Manager of a Registry of the Federal Circuit and Family Court\nof Australia (Division 1).\n(2)\nThe Minister may, in writing, determine that subitem (1) does not apply\nin relation to a specified thing done by, or in relation to, the Registry\nManager of a Registry of the Family Court of Australia.\n(3)\nTo avoid doubt, doing a thing includes making an instrument.\n(4)\nA determination under subitem (2) is not a legislative instrument."
    },
