    {
      "@id": "concept:c2021a00013rec01-sch-5-sec-11",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "11 Things done by, or in relation to, the Marshal or a Deputy",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2021a00013rec01#sch-5-sec-11"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2021a00013rec01.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2021a00013rec01.pdf, p.219",
      "values:originalText": "Marshal\n(1)\nIf a thing was done by, or in relation to, the Marshal or a Deputy\nMarshal of the Family Court of Australia, then the thing is taken, for the\npurposes of the operation of any law on and after the commencement\nday, to have been done by, or in relation to, the Marshal or a Deputy\nMarshal of the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia\n(Division 1).\n(2)\nThe Minister may, in writing, determine that subitem (1) does not apply\nin relation to a specified thing done by, or in relation to, the Marshal or\na Deputy Marshal of the Family Court of Australia.\n(3)\nTo avoid doubt, doing a thing includes making an instrument.\n(4)\nA determination under subitem (2) is not a legislative instrument.\n\nSchedule 5  Transitional provisions",
      "skos:definition": "Marshal\n(1)\nIf a thing was done by, or in relation to, the Marshal or a Deputy\nMarshal of the Family Court of Australia, then the thing is taken, for the\npurposes of the operation of any law on and after the commencement\nday, to have been done by, or in relation to, the Marshal or a Deputy\nMarshal of the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia\n(Division 1).\n(2)\nThe Minister may, in writing, determine that subitem (1) does not apply\nin relation to a specified thing done by, or in relation to, the Marshal or\na Deputy Marshal of the Family Court of Australia.\n(3)\nTo avoid doubt, doing a thing includes making an instrument.\n(4)\nA determination under subitem (2) is not a legislative instrument.\n\nSchedule 5  Transitional provisions",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2021a00013rec01-sch-5-sec-11-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2021a00013rec01-sch-5-sec-11-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2021a00013rec01-sch-5-sec-11-logic-descriptionlogic-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2021a00013rec01-sch-5-sec-11-logic-alleninterval-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "43a5fe3e501b7fd2bdc0791d3c1abfc33b71b1412de5f2c6e260fbb2a15c89b3",
      "skos:note": "Things done by, or in relation to, the Marshal or a Deputy are taken as having been done by, or in relation to, the Marshal or a Deputy of the specified court."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2021a00013rec01#sch-5-sec-11",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "11 Things done by, or in relation to, the Marshal or a Deputy",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 219,
      "values:originalText": "Marshal\n(1)\nIf a thing was done by, or in relation to, the Marshal or a Deputy\nMarshal of the Family Court of Australia, then the thing is taken, for the\npurposes of the operation of any law on and after the commencement\nday, to have been done by, or in relation to, the Marshal or a Deputy\nMarshal of the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia\n(Division 1).\n(2)\nThe Minister may, in writing, determine that subitem (1) does not apply\nin relation to a specified thing done by, or in relation to, the Marshal or\na Deputy Marshal of the Family Court of Australia.\n(3)\nTo avoid doubt, doing a thing includes making an instrument.\n(4)\nA determination under subitem (2) is not a legislative instrument.\n\nSchedule 5  Transitional provisions"
    },
    {
