      },
      "dc:source": "c2021a00013rec01.pdf, p.221",
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nThe office of Chief Judge of the Federal Circuit Court of Australia\nunder the old law is the same office as the office of Chief Judge of the\nFederal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Division 2) under the\nnew law.\n(2)\nThe office of Judge (other than Chief Judge) of the Federal Circuit\nCourt of Australia under the old law is the same office as the office of\nJudge of the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Division 2)\nunder the new law.\n(3)\nIn this item:\nold law means the Federal Circuit Court of Australia Act 1999, as in\nforce immediately before the commencement day.",
      "skos:definition": "(1)\nThe office of Chief Judge of the Federal Circuit Court of Australia\nunder the old law is the same office as the office of Chief Judge of the\nFederal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Division 2) under the\nnew law.\n(2)\nThe office of Judge (other than Chief Judge) of the Federal Circuit\nCourt of Australia under the old law is the same office as the office of\nJudge of the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Division 2)\nunder the new law.\n(3)\nIn this item:\nold law means the Federal Circuit Court of Australia Act 1999, as in\nforce immediately before the commencement day.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2021a00013rec01-sch-5-sec-14-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "eb2ab1827cb4d3032b0ee1dd798a024f72cf5b7bdd8bbe3c56941f2a4d94202f",
      "skos:note": "Change in title of judicial offices"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2021a00013rec01#sch-5-sec-14",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "14 Change in title of judicial offices",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 221,
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nThe office of Chief Judge of the Federal Circuit Court of Australia\nunder the old law is the same office as the office of Chief Judge of the\nFederal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Division 2) under the\nnew law.\n(2)\nThe office of Judge (other than Chief Judge) of the Federal Circuit\nCourt of Australia under the old law is the same office as the office of\nJudge of the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Division 2)\nunder the new law.\n(3)\nIn this item:\nold law means the Federal Circuit Court of Australia Act 1999, as in\nforce immediately before the commencement day."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2021a00013rec01-sch-5-sec-14-norm",
