      "dc:source": "c2021a00013rec01.pdf, p.238",
      "values:originalText": "Interpretation Act 1901\nThis Schedule does not limit the operation of section 7 or\nsubsection 25B(1) of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901.\n[Minister’s second reading speech made in—\nHouse of Representatives on 5 December 2019\nSenate on 2 December 2020]\n(249/19)",
      "skos:definition": "Interpretation Act 1901\nThis Schedule does not limit the operation of section 7 or\nsubsection 25B(1) of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901.\n[Minister’s second reading speech made in—\nHouse of Representatives on 5 December 2019\nSenate on 2 December 2020]\n(249/19)",
      "cml:asserts": [
